  "solution": "Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Dựa vào hình vẽ ta thấy đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> đi qua hai điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, từ đó ta có hệ phương trình\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tDo đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác miền nghiệm bao gồm cả đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>d</mi></semantics></math> nên bất phương trình có dạng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta thấy miền nghiệm không chứa điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, có nghĩa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> không là nghiệm của bất phương trình bậc nhất hai ẩn, thay tọa độ vào <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> bất phương trình trên ta thấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> không là nghiệm của bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t<br>Vậy miền nghiệm là  của bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
